 "headline": "Thug Life Rides McDaniels Past MONSTARS",
 "notes": [
  "Thug Life took FG% and AST off MONSTARS \u2604\ufe0f while Jaden McDaniels dropped 34 and 10, and Tyler Herro's 32 points couldn't save the lead.",
  "Adam Silver Dez Nuts has Shai Gilgeous-Alexander on the bench for 38 points and 4 threes, and he's still up 8-2 on White Mambas.",
  "Zero Fox Given took DREB from Suggs to be you, and Myles Turner's 27 and 11 on 9-of-12 shooting did the damage.",
  "LeParth James grabbed PTS from Nova Knicks, then watched Svi Mykhailiuk go 0-for-1 and Anfernee Simons score 3 on a dead night.",
  "Keldon Johnson has nothing worth printing for Nova Knicks, and Devin Vassell's 1-of-7 is sinking Gopher Gold's FG% tonight."
 ],
